          <p class="card__text">Three real attack paths from our internal pentests, and the two-tier fix list that closes them.</p>
          <span class="card__go card__go--text">Read Checklist {{ arrow() }}</span>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a class="card rv" style="--d:1" href="/whitepapers/web-application-security-checklist/">
